{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-058eb3bd2b2e7f4af696","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"고장 발견, 긴급 수리 중……","speaker":"바쁜 소형 로봇","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10182568303934822487"],"speakerHashCandidates":["5701536452682206438"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-449e647d6458c79263da","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"인식 오류, 인식 오류. 그래서… 이유가 뭐지?","speaker":"곤혹스러운 소형 로봇","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2883006106582721017"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8801081359742992768"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-340e88941878b3422943","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"로봇들이 도와주니 훨씬 편리하네","speaker":"낙천적인 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16427710430255442969"],"speakerHashCandidates":["15855897915112621019"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-d6f4689b28b0a52f90a2","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"이제 복구 프로세스가 끝나면 완•매 님을 위해 무언가를 준비하자. 음, 뭘 준비하지?","speaker":"낙천적인 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16776387530829276279"],"speakerHashCandidates":["15855897915112621019"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-02c5e1032390d452568a","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"뭐든 상관없어. 엄청난 서프라이즈를 준비하자!","speaker":"열정적인 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5474518620097317182"],"speakerHashCandidates":["4376015208675073797"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-6edf1ea88fa68b093690","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"분명 좋아하실 거야","speaker":"낙천적인 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17546440829398027771"],"speakerHashCandidates":["15855897915112621019"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-de2ddd9d2c93484d5517","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"저 로봇들은… 가동한 뒤로 지금까지 멈추지 않고 일만 하고 있대","speaker":"놀란 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12759575953254911968"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3369017668962417530"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-87a8a4cc74c37bf74ad2","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"누구한테 들었어?","speaker":"냉담한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9922313121270546345"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8603155257841956518"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-d3f776b707af06e4a9a6","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"「왕짜증」이 무의식중에 말했어. 게다가 내가 관찰해 보니 그들은 하루 종일……","speaker":"놀란 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15386543124083985154"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3369017668962417530"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-15faedebf50f62ff1b7b","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"지어낸 거야, 말도 안 돼! 로봇은 충전이 필요하다고","speaker":"냉담한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8985578022486980407"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8603155257841956518"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-5f805bb09ebcb9416ed7","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"이제… 다시는… 사랑할 수 없을 것 같아","speaker":"슬픈 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3605413610513220516"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11472227089158139224"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-1a06c73e5e924347d1d2","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"맞아. 나도……","speaker":"우울한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4176269566004724343"],"speakerHashCandidates":["590523578035010391"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-82b1a5c8b3a2821bc3ea","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"그녀야. 그녀가 우릴 버린 거야… 우리의 마음도 그녀를 따라 떠났어","speaker":"슬픈 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12442544660027147912"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11472227089158139224"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-9134df553753d7716f9d","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"난 이제 그녀를 위해 울지 않을 거야. 내 눈물은… 이미 다 흘렸으니까","speaker":"우울한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3795603523383866957"],"speakerHashCandidates":["590523578035010391"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-89ca15d7061128051aaf","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"응? 버터 파인애플빵인가? 네 몸에서 향기가 나……","speaker":"지나가는 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17972796678136800462"],"speakerHashCandidates":["5696241574123556828"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-8f5e0314c7c2915f106e","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"버터가 녹은 「눈물」은 정말 향기롭네. 너무 좋아!","speaker":"지나가는 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6501082406654682233"],"speakerHashCandidates":["5696241574123556828"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-750bc27ac4542ff3d4b9","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"그가 먼 곳으로 가는 길을 찾고 있다고 들었어……","speaker":"확고한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18338752947799911802"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8018636938161847177"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-784acc3c4a1b81c9642c","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"게다가 그는 우리 중 유일하게 말을 할 수 있는 녀석이잖아","speaker":"어리둥절한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1000647605651304977"],"speakerHashCandidates":["7982215158688112202"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-0733850c2697439b70f8","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"너도 그를 찾으러 갈 거야? 그가 떠난 지 얼마 안 됐다던데","speaker":"확고한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14402025832672470293"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8018636938161847177"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-46196ebdb2c45522f24a","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"우린 진작 이곳을 떠났어야 했어. 여기 있는 건 생명을 낭비하는 일이야!","speaker":"확고한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17970961344665907323"],"speakerHashCandidates":["8018636938161847177"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-8fc9d4151f897b39abea","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"방금 「통찰자」 님의 강의를 들었는데 정말 대단해!","speaker":"흥분한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1608523108033298634"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1207407759364684300"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-e1d63b52e8bdcea049ab","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"그 녀석은 제정신이 아니라서 보고 있으면 너무 짜증 나","speaker":"거만한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3786832551536771383"],"speakerHashCandidates":["18207406758393586018"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-27391d06ff63833df580","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"그렇게 말하지 마. 그는 우주정거장의 많은 곳을 가봤고 식견도 넓어. 그리고… 완•매 님도 그를 좋아한다고","speaker":"흥분한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["609996440437813791"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1207407759364684300"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-0c2f795c926ce2c37231","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"쯧, 난 그 말 안 믿어. 넌 모르지? 그 녀석의 본명은 「치즈폭탄」이야. 촌스러운 주제에 뭘 아는 척이람, 흥……","speaker":"거만한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12152587740795703802"],"speakerHashCandidates":["18207406758393586018"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-60396849345d51be98fd","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"…날 창조해 놓고 왜 이곳에 날 버린 거지……","speaker":"외톨이 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7856474206754898754"],"speakerHashCandidates":["10254846928266731815"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-5a4e773c0eee42305ad1","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"아니야, 그녀의 잘못이 아니야. 다… 내 탓이야","speaker":"외톨이 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11854348421424919781"],"speakerHashCandidates":["10254846928266731815"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-55035b10ee63432b23ff","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"사랑과 배려, 이런 건 원래부터 내 것이 아니었어","speaker":"외톨이 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2299775507954447056"],"speakerHashCandidates":["10254846928266731815"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-0129ea118e488d23206b","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"난 쓰레기야… 아니, 난 아무것도 아니야. 난 그저 공허한 존재……","speaker":"외톨이 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3683095580792706633"],"speakerHashCandidates":["10254846928266731815"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-851517ac6e67f06d3e27","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"밖은 무서워, 만약 「혁혁한 명성」 님이 안 계셨더라면 우린… 흑흑!","speaker":"소심한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8558994721515589120"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1720468058703810413"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-3d10d1a4b6246958fa2f","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"나도 온정 언니처럼… 이름을 갖고 싶어. 멋지잖아","speaker":"호기심 많은 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14958914422444599674"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1561056032565357243"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-12f2cad554fa07104213","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"그 훌쩍거리는 녀석에게 들었는데 연구원들은 다 성이 있대. 그래서 말인데 온 씨 뒤에 올 이름은 정했어?","speaker":"상냥한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15199033079115785503"],"speakerHashCandidates":["2167378688554393611"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-2c1f9c7bf2867edaed8a","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"그… 조셉이 「소환」한… 모델 말하는 거야?","speaker":"호기심 많은 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16240956667326532248"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1561056032565357243"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-d53786bed99116d47620","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","text":"맞아. 걔는 우리 머리 위에 산다고 들었어……","speaker":"상냥한 완•매의 창조물","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 6","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14297317109866142085"],"speakerHashCandidates":["2167378688554393611"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p2402","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"互动文本/空间站","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-058eb3bd2b2e7f4af696","rowId":"other-interaction-p2402-058eb3bd2b2e7f4af696","missionId":"interaction-p2402","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","scene":"상호작용 6","contextId":"wiki-context-19834e3e194c0a48157e0a4a","page":"互动文本/空间站","revision":42476,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-449e647d6458c79263da","rowId":"other-interaction-p2402-449e647d6458c79263da","missionId":"interaction-p2402","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","scene":"상호작용 6","contextId":"wiki-context-f6777ba4f9523ac32b2d1bde","page":"互动文本/空间站","revision":42476,"location":[4,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-340e88941878b3422943","rowId":"other-interaction-p2402-340e88941878b3422943","missionId":"interaction-p2402","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","scene":"상호작용 6","contextId":"wiki-context-5a4c03fada6ac42bd9d481f5","page":"互动文本/空间站","revision":42476,"location":[9,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-d6f4689b28b0a52f90a2","rowId":"other-interaction-p2402-d6f4689b28b0a52f90a2","missionId":"interaction-p2402","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sade63cb86a5e5ab4","scene":"상호작용 6","contextId":"wiki-context-d9ea1a9f3c1518e16ca3062a","page":"互动文本/空间站","revision":42476,"location":[9,2],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p2402-02c5e1032390d452568a"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-02c5e1032390d452568a","rowId":"other-interaction-p24